--- HANDOFF.md 3e547b4b0fbb53d6ee024006e2b13ca1e8e7c72d06126df7ee6562086c646678 ---
1: # Typed PIPESTATUS six-probe reference preparation
2: 
3: Date: 2026-08-29. AUTHOR READY for DIFFERENT preexecution review. **No actual native authority. P19–P24 all UNRUN; no expected outputs or semantic policy chosen.**
4: 
5: Exact root-supplied literals are in PROGRAMS.json and materialized/programs; six hashes/argv/env/empty-stdin bindings in COHORT/REQUESTS. P19 is exactly declare -p PIPESTATUS as first command, no prologue. No eval/source/profile/external command/variable-command/slash lookup/network/private path. Only fixed f invocations, builtin declarations/readonly/assignment/true/false and two finite pipelines. Zero fixtures and zero permitted effects.
6: 
7: Parent author5861ec9a8750de90bf38f93a2cd0df66198e8d9f; independent98192974514389759c96d20c7f35fe6050641c76; ROOTcf6c47b8a976bb71bd6dd419c103e23264e71a32 are retained references, not reused authority. SOURCE-AUTH.json binds selected stored parent blobs and fresh tool hashes. Three owner modules change (admission/entry/observation); six remain byte-identical. Old F05 effects permission is removed, all lookups forbidden, IDs/counts/profile/paths are separately versioned. Host FNPIPEOBS1 framing and raw byte preservation remain unchanged.
8: 
9: DATA controls 12/12 PASS, 0 FAIL, 120 assertions. Three changed-module Node syntax children retired. No lifecycle fixture child, Bash, actual entry, native version, compiler/build/product/Worker or network ran. Bootstrap syntax/prepare/controls are the three controller images. All individual raw captures and failures, if any, are retained.
10: 
11: Executable preseal SHA256 ade56f23358e284df533f7e57e462ba927fb0386899061e90699977746424b6e; control result 72198874fe7144bbdbe45d75bd02311f0a4ba5869f46679a3d5995d13fdad7cc; exact prospective command string d4e97d0e932825d3c8318792b2c2d98bd4aa997800805f95bdfa1f091326140e. New runtime review/GO templates have strict finite fields and reject PENDING/non-numeric/old-profile authority. issued/expiry/latest-start UTC remain PENDING. Future preprovision must create fresh owned parents and empty journal; bootstrap captures remain absent until the exact noclobber/read-write wrapper. No actual root or runtime slot file is created here.
12: 
13: Prospective actual:600s inclusive/setup60s/tail60s, case3s/TERM2/KILL1;7 managed(owner1+Bash6)+4 UNOBSERVED stage reservations(P22/P23 two each)+18 admin=29 proposed slots. Managed peak2+2 unobserved stage allowance+margin1=peak5. Not observed census or OS quota.64KiB/stream,32MiB capture,128MiB work. Exact six-key child environment, owned empty PATH, no BASH_ENV/ENV/exported functions, --noprofile --norc. Initial tool/zsh startup remains trusted host outside child clean-env/raw-capture qualification; no containment or GNU5.3 claim.
14: 
15: Actual recipe: DIFFERENT preexec ACCEPT, fresh committed runtime ROOT review/GO/preprovision and fixed UTC window, separate resolved sole-slot DATA review, then EXACT exec_command require_escalated/login:false/no prefix with sealed APPROVAL-PROPOSAL.template.json parameters. No automatic follow-on, old grant reuse or actual request.
16: 
17: Old26/12/37 observations, accounting holds and ambiguities remain unchanged. These six unrun type probes are intended to distinguish startup/readonly indexed versus nonarray/local bindings; preparation alone resolves none. F05 timing and ordinary command-substitution source limits are not rescored.
18: 
